# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# The Xcode project, unlike gen/android, is NOT committed. Nobody here has a
# Mac to regenerate or maintain it, so a checked-in copy would rot silently
# and nobody would notice until someone with an Apple account tried to use it.
# The iOS probe workflow generates it fresh on every run instead.
/gen/apple
